## Decisions and Action Items

* **MOA RTR PDU & RTR Versioning:** Discussion on whether to advance RTR PDU extensions for MOA or defer RTR v3 work until RTR v2 operational feedback is collected will continue on the working group mailing list.
* **Push Mode for RTR:** Proponents were directed to the mailing list to provide concrete operational use cases demonstrating where existing RFC 8210 RP pacing mechanisms are insufficient.

---

## Next Steps

* **[draft-ietf-sidrops-moa-profile](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-ietf-sidrops-moa-profile/):** Authors will continue incorporating working group feedback on the base profile draft.
* **Incremental RP Validation:** Authors will share performance optimization insights with RP implementers via the mailing list rather than pursuing an RFC track document.